<http://data.silknow.org/object/2697eac9-1dc6-3db1-b387-bbcb65880f17>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Band samplers are composed of horizontal rows (\"bands\") of embroidered patterns stitched along the linen foundation fabric. Many of the patterns stitched onto band can be traced to sixteenth-century pattern books, and often include depictions of fruit, flowers, and geometric patterns. This sampler is made up of bands of varying heights that feature birds, acorns, pineapples, and a variety of flowers. The bottom of the sampler includes an alphabet consisting of a mix of uppercase and lowercase letters and small, seemingly randomly placed motifs, resembling a spot sampler."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/72f16f2e-d785-38aa-8e56-8077fc6dbdbd> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Band samplers are composed of horizontal rows (\"bands\") of embroidered patterns stitched along the linen foundation fabric. Many of the patterns stitched onto band can be traced to sixteenth-century pattern books, and often include depictions of fruit, flowers, and geometric patterns. This sampler is made up of bands of varying heights that feature birds, acorns, pineapples, and a variety of flowers. The bottom of the sampler includes an alphabet consisting of a mix of uppercase and lowercase letters and small, seemingly randomly placed motifs, resembling a spot sampler."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "57.122.284" ;
